title: "When does a typed x or s become ! or *?"
accTitle: "Close-outcome letter alias eligibility"
accDescr: "A typed x or s is swapped to bang or star. The swap sticks only for a whole-item close, a past close after the second equals, or an already claimed link close whose close lexer accepts the candidate. Start names and past E names keep the letter."
config:
