flowchart TD
  Q1{{"`**Key is x or s?**`"}}
  SWAP["`**Swap x to !**<br/>swap s to *`"]
  Q2{{"`**Close family?**`"}}
  Q3{{"`**Lexer accepts?**`"}}
  FAM["`**Whole-item x…**<br/>past after second =<br/>claimed link close`"]
  REW["`**Rewrite the byte**`"]
  LIT["`**Keep the letter**`"]
